---
title: Invalid Malformed Model Fields
type: app
status: active
created: "2026-07-15"
---

# Invalid: unknown field type and unrecognized constraint

`joined` uses the misspelled type `timestampz` (parser silently coerces it
to string), and `title` carries the misspelled constraint `maxx=200`
(parser silently drops it).

::app[name=malformed-fields port=8080]

:::model[name=User]
- id: uuid [primary, auto]
- email: email [required, unique]
- joined: timestampz
:::

:::model[name=Note]
- id: uuid [primary, auto]
- title: string [required, maxx=200]
- owner_id: ref(User) [required]
:::

:::auth[provider=email]
session: cookie
:::

::
